    "title": "Rustic Canyon Recreation Center to host joint family Halloween carnival on Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carlos Reyes ,\n17 hours ago\nNeighborhood families from Pacific Palisades and Santa Monica can enjoy bounce houses, carnival games, and a library haunted house. Families across Pacific Palisades and Santa Monica can take part in a community Halloween celebration Saturday as municipal park officials team up to host an afternoon carnival filled with seasonal activities.\nRead full article",
